00:04:00.515 --> 00:04:03.206 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>Here's the game.
You're going to balance on that bar.</c>

00:04:03.206 --> 00:04:04.343 line:85%
Right.

00:04:04.343 --> 00:04:07.245 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm going to bounce this ball at you.
You're going to try and catch it.</c>

00:04:07.245 --> 00:04:08.485 line:85%
Okay.

00:04:08.485 --> 00:04:10.900 line:91%
<c.yellow>If you fall,
you're going to grab the bar.</c>

00:04:16.227 --> 00:04:17.193 line:85%
<c.yellow>Very good.</c>

00:04:19.483 --> 00:04:21.201 line:85%
<c.yellow>Fandabidozi.</c>

00:04:21.486 --> 00:04:23.020 position:61% line:85%
<c.yellow>So we've got a slightly higher bar now,</c>

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.478 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>and we're still gonna be working on
