00:04:25.478 --> 00:04:28.938 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>we're gonna kind of build on this idea of
getting down safely from the bar.</c>

00:04:28.938 --> 00:04:31.616 position:61% line:91%
<c.yellow>So we're gonna be using
the front of our foot here, on the bar,</c>

00:04:31.616 --> 00:04:33.852 line:91%
<c.yellow>and the opposing hand
