00:04:49.451 --> 00:04:53.013 line:91%
That looks like some
foundational thing just there.

00:04:53.013 --> 00:04:54.937 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>You're learning foundational parkour.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:04:55.437 --> 00:04:56.968 line:85%
Ohh!

00:04:56.968 --> 00:04:58.248 line:91%
Oh no.
<c.yellow>Hey!</c>

