00:05:10.325 --> 00:05:12.172 position:59% line:85%
What I did there was I missed the bar.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.950 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (synth arpeggio)</i></c>

00:05:12.672 --> 00:05:14.163 line:85%
<c.yellow>Next skill...</c>

00:05:15.445 --> 00:05:16.954 line:85%
<c.yellow>You're gonna sit on this box.</c>

00:05:16.954 --> 00:05:18.212 line:91%
I can do that.
<c.yellow>Excellent.</c>

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.550 align:start position:0% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (retro electronic dance music)</i></c>

00:05:18.212 --> 00:05:20.001 line:91%
Okay.
<c.yellow>Good.</c>

00:05:20.001 --> 00:05:23.801 line:85%
<c.yellow>Turn, down, down.</c>

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:25.659 line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>...Alright.</c>

00:05:25.659 --> 00:05:26.718 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'll be here to catch you.</c>
