00:05:35.261 --> 00:05:37.909 line:85%
<i>(wheezes)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Okay. I'll take that.</c>

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.350 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>(music fades)</i></c>

00:05:38.336 --> 00:05:40.832 line:91%
<c.yellow>This is gonna be our first exposure
